    {
      "text": "どく　まひ　やけど　のじょうたいで\nわざを　だすと　２ばいの　いりょくで\nこうげき　できる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "독, 마비, 화상 상태에서\n기술을 쓰면 2배의 위력으로\n공격할 수 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une attaque dont la puissance double lorsque\nle lanceur est empoisonné, paralysé ou brûlé.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ist der Anwender vergiftet, paralysiert oder leidet\ner unter Verbrennungen, verdoppelt sich die Kraft\nder Attacke.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Llamas que golpean a los objetivos adyacentes.\nSi estos llevan bayas u otros objetos, estos se\nquemarán y ya no se podrán usar.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Mossa d’attacco che raddoppia la potenza\nse chi la usa è scottato, avvelenato o paralizzato.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An attack move that doubles its power if\nthe user is poisoned, burned, or\nhas paralysis.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "x-y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/15/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "自分が　どく　まひ　やけど\n状態のとき　相手に　くりだすと\n技の　威力が　２倍に　なる。",
